Date: Thu, 29 Oct 2026 17:22:47 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 3/8] Hide Pro upsells, DocuSeal console/plans/SMS/SSO settings
 and docuseal.com pricing links

From the JT patches 0003/0004/0006, without brand-specific content. Pro
features stay locked; they are only no longer advertised. The template
builder logo comes from the brand pack.

Upsell links are hidden by public/brand-base/hide-upsells.css, matched by
their target URL, instead of rewriting the conditions in the upstream
templates. Upstream changes those conditions often (3.3.5 added
turbo_native_app? checks), which made this patch conflict on updates.
